  "title": "Macaroni Salad with a Twist",
  "description": "Seashell pasta tossed with chopped carrots, green bell pepper, celery, and cooked ham in a lively mustard-mayo-white vinegar dressing is a flavor-packed variation on traditional macaroni salad.",
